  <p>For purposes of this requirement, “Illegal immigrant” means any person not a citizen of the United States who has:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Entered the United States in violation of the Federal Immigration and Naturalization Act or regulations issued the act;</li>
    <li>Legally entered but without the right to be employed in the United States; or</li>
