  <p>Pursuant to Arkansas Code Annotated § 25-1-503, a Public Entity shall not enter into a contract valued at $1,000 or greater with a contractor unless the contractor certifies that the contractor is not currently engaged in, and agrees for the duration of the contract not to engage in, a boycott of Israel.</p>

